 "\[LineSeparator]low-level form taking explicit per-tensor index lists, the \
output indices, and a size-per-index ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["Association",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/Association"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "2901f0e5-e26c-44c6-94ab-b20a458f2448"],
 "."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->131187114,ExpressionUUID->"5958088f-0baa-42e6-bcd8-aea122b7f154"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["GreedyContractionPath",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/GreedyContractionPath"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"2ca21c69-be3b-4215-8937-8dd948b73b61"],
 " returns the same canonical path format as ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["OptimalContractionPath",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/OptimalContractionPath"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"7e832252-84d5-46c3-b5ac-addd88359119"],
 ": a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["List",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:ref/List"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b4e8eaad-1504-4de1-b887-23b4a2ee69e2"],
 " of integer pairs ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"{", 
   StyleBox["i", "TI"], ",", 
   StyleBox["j", "TI"], "}"}]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "021ddbbe-98b5-46b9-87ea-2ac4d5984c87"],
 " in opt_einsum convention. At each step the two tensors at positions ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "eb341dbc-fbe0-4901-8656-050b16ff9aa1"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  StyleBox["j", "TI"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "8cb4e4d1-1573-4241-8a16-c02dc0528652"],
 " are removed and the contraction result is appended at the end of the \
list."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->952787092,ExpressionUUID->"f9f0549f-8432-4ba4-a3d3-7e0c63a17a03"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The greedy search is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"\[ScriptCapitalO]", "(", "n", ")"}]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"eb3445fb-742b-40b5-8907-0060d7aafec8"],
 " per step in the network size, so it scales to hundreds of tensors where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["OptimalContractionPath",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/TensorNetworks/ref/OptimalContractionPath"]], 
  "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->"ee2647c6-65a8-4939-8f15-16cb25559f32"],
 " is intractable. Paths are not provably optimal but in practice are within \
a small constant factor."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->495042975,ExpressionUUID->"d80f3f6d-7480-4c82-b37d-d287cf7612d1"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The search is backed by the Rust library function ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<optimize_greedy\>\""], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a6c83008-e572-4ae0-87df-7d987fd4611b"],
 " from ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox[
   RowBox[{"Wolfram", "/", "PacletExtensions"}],
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:Wolfram/PacletExtensions"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"898da17c-791f-473d-9968-f5bde252f8cf"],
 ", loaded on first use through ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["ExtensionCargo",
   BaseStyle->"Link"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "a534cd30-218a-46cd-b5a1-c55a4df99545"],
 "."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->856099490,ExpressionUUID->"5ca0545a-62bd-4126-8852-65be7ce85350"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Setting ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<Temperature\>\""], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "b829f3fb-2ab2-4df8-aec1-2425a89b5094"],
 " to a numeric value enables stochastic local search; combined with ",
 Cell[BoxData["\"\<RandomSeed\>\""], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "46a274ff-681b-4644-9f6e-80c5395fcdec"],
 " this produces deterministic-but-randomized paths, useful for benchmarking \
ensembles."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->514389114,ExpressionUUID->"80c6d72e-1d8c-498b-9fea-76794dabe6cd"],

Cell["The following options can be given: ", "Notes",
 CellID->477979075,ExpressionUUID->"7c77ca7c-8651-4cc9-af15-6c7ef6e6c6f0"],

